Fork status
-----------

This directory is a fork of the upstream improved-diffusion code, adapted
for integration with the GSSC-S2D2 codebase, with the additional files
above taken from the other three upstreams. GSSC-authored modifications are
released under the same terms as the file they modify; they do not place any
upstream author's code under this project's own MIT grant, and they do not
create a license where an upstream publishes none (see project 4).
